<!--
  The solution manifest every fixture solution is stamped out of. build.ps1 replaces the
  doubled-brace tokens below and checks that none are left; nothing else in here varies.

  Managed, and that is the whole point. Deleting an unmanaged solution leaves every
  component behind in the Default solution, so unregister.ps1 would unregister nothing.
  Deleting a managed one takes the steps, images, plugin types and assemblies with it.

  The Addresses block is boilerplate the publisher element requires and nothing reads.
-->
